== JKTLUG × openSUSE Indonesia: Release Party openSUSE Leap 16.1 ==
JKTLUG and openSUSE Indonesia are hosting a release party to introduce openSUSE Leap 16.1 and bring together Linux and open-source enthusiasts in Jakarta.

== Agenda ==
* Introduction to openSUSE Leap 16.1
* Live openSUSE Leap 16.1 installation demo
* Nix package manager on openSUSE
* Quiz with merchandise and prizes
* Pizza party and networking

The talks include time for questions and answers. The event is open to students, Linux practitioners and enthusiasts, open-source users, and anyone interested in technology. Expected attendance is 30–40 people.

